  "live_records": {
    "q-166797": {
      "dom_id": "question-166797",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Expressed as a single fraction, the exact area of the plot of land is$\\,$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \n${\\text{mi}}^{2}.$",
      "worked_solution": "The exact area of land is ${(\\frac{4}{5})}^{2}\\,{\\text{mi}}^{2}.$\n\nWriting ${(\\frac{4}{5})}^{2}$ with multiplication signs, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(\\frac{4}{5})}^{2} & ={{\\frac{4}{5}\\times \\frac{4}{5}}_{⏟}}_{2\\text{ times}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\times 4}{5\\times 5} \\\\  & =\\frac{16}{25}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{(\\frac{4}{5})}^{2}=\\frac{16}{25}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
